# Round 18, C2-13 (fixed). L §5.19: "bal(x, d) modelled is the model's own balance of the modelled past on a covered day:
# from x's last reading before d, plus the planned movements that touch x ... Comparing it with the reading is the
# residual"; E §6.2 now "its last reading before d (the opening, before the first)". L5_19_modelled_decision_less_own_obs
# with a reading of konto at 2026-01-31 end, 700.00 PLN (the booked 1 000.00 - 300.00, gap 0): the modelled balance
# on 2026-01-31 starts from the opening (1 000.00), not from that reading, and the modelled sweep moves 500.00 out:
# 500.00 PLN (snap11: 700.00, the reading itself). q2 alone lists no reading in its register.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input keep: money PLN
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move sweep[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0, bal(konto) - keep)

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-01-08, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to savings amount 300.00 PLN, fulfils: sweep[2026-01]) "line 1"
  stated[konto] = 700.00 PLN at 2026-01-31 end "saldo"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-31), bal(konto, 2026-01-31) modelled
ask q2: bal(konto, 2026-01-31) modelled

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 500.00 PLN "own"
  dom = 10 "own"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect
q: (700.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN)
  pad: konto 2026-01-31 end, pads:stmt:konto@2026-01-31 end of 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-20
q2: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-20
